Descriptor SpecialEducationSetting
    documentation 'This descriptor defines the major instructional setting (more than 50 percent of 
    'a student's special education program).
    with optional map type
        item Inside regular class 80% or more of the day
        item Inside regular class no more than 79% of day and no less than 40% of the day
        item Inside regular class less than 40% of the day
        item Separate School
        item Residential Facility
        item Homebound/Hospital
        item Correctional Facilities
        item Parentally-placed in Private Schools

